1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,060
On Venus,

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,588
one day lasts longer

3
00:00:02,588 --> 00:00:04,700
than your whole YEAR.

4
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:07,320
Venus is the laziest planet...

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,900
it barely spins.

6
00:00:08,948 --> 00:00:10,750
It laps the whole Sun

7
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:13,133
in two hundred and twenty-five days...

8
00:00:13,176 --> 00:00:15,016
but takes two hundred and forty-three

9
00:00:15,016 --> 00:00:17,440
to turn around ONCE.

10
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:19,440
So you'd be a year older...

11
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:21,455
before you're a day older.

12
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:24,348
Oh, and it spins BACKWARDS...

13
00:00:24,348 --> 00:00:25,322
so the Sun comes up

14
00:00:25,322 --> 00:00:26,920
in the WEST.

15
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,523
Happy birthday.

16
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,883
It's still...

17
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:31,080
Monday.

